          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Light Reflection"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(primal, evocation)\n\nThe gold defender reshapes its skin into a reflective surface that magnifies ambient light into a precise beam that burns all creatures in a 30-foot cone, dealing 14d6 fire damage (DC 31 Reflex save if the gold defender is in dim light, DC 33 Reflex save if it's in bright light). It can't use Light Reflection again for 1d4 rounds.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
